---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="联系我们 - 机场实力榜 | jcslbang.homes" description="联系机场实力榜 编辑部。提交数据纠错、价格更正、文章反馈与技术交流。">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 space-y-8">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: '联系我们' }]} />

    <!-- Page Header Banner -->
    <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 rounded-2xl text-white shadow-lg space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full text-xs font-bold">
        <span>📫 读者反馈 · 节点纠错 · 合作交流 · 防失联指南</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black">联系我们</h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-blue-100 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        欢迎与机场实力榜编辑部取得联系。无论您是在教程使用中遇到疑问、发现某家机场的价格或节点发生变动，还是希望提交测速纠错，我们都将及时进行复核与更正。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Container -->
    <article class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm space-y-8">
      
      <!-- Feedback Methods -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-3">
          <span>✈️</span>
          <span>官方 Telegram 反馈渠道</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          为保证沟通的时效性与安全性，编辑部主要通过 Telegram 官方频道与读者交流。您可以直接加入频道获取每日测速动态与订阅异常排查指南：
        </p>

        <div class="p-6 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700/80 space-y-3 not-prose">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">✈️ 机场实力榜 Telegram 官方频道</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 rounded-full">实时响应</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
            频道链接：<a href="https://t.me/+rGDXqHbxorZjN2Jl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-mono underline hover:text-blue-700">https://t.me/+rGDXqHbxorZjN2Jl</a>
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2">
            <a
              href="https://t.me/+rGDXqHbxorZjN2Jl"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 bg-sky-500 hover:bg-sky-600 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-xs transition-colors shadow-sm"
            >
              <span>加入 Telegram 官方频道</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Common Guidelines -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-3">
          <span>📝</span>
          <span>留言与纠错说明</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          <div class="p-4 bg-amber-50/50 dark:bg-amber-950/30 rounded-xl border border-amber-200/80 dark:border-amber-900/60">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200 text-sm mb-1">1. 价格与优惠码纠错</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
              机场服务商会不定期更新优惠折扣与套餐计费。如果您发现某家机场的优惠码失效或价格发生调整，请附带该机场名称与最新结算页截图联系我们。
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-blue-50/50 dark:bg-blue-950/30 rounded-xl border border-blue-200/80 dark:border-blue-900/60">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm mb-1">2. 客户端配置与报错求助</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
              关于 Clash Verge Rev、Shadowrocket (小火箭)、Sing-box 及 v2rayN 的订阅失败与 TUN 模式冲突问题，请先阅读本站【客户端教程】或【避坑答疑 100 问】，若仍未解决可在 Telegram 频道留言。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
